*** Keywords ***

Suite Setup 9158
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     customs configurations yamlPathname
    ...     Actions:        it performs the generic suite setup and backup the configurations files
    ...     Checks:         it checks nothing more than already done on lib.
    ...     Verdict:        suite setup is passed
    [Arguments]             ${yamlPathname}=${EMPTY}

    Setup.Suite Setup from scratch        yamlPathname=${yamlPathname}
    ...                                   listBackupFiles=${FD_ALL}

    Backup Files
    ${scf_suite_setup_backup}         OAM Get SCF File    file=SCF_Suite_Setup_Backup.xml
    Set Suite Variable      ${scf_suite_setup_backup}
    Dated Log               SCF backup file = ${scf_suite_setup_backup}         

TC 9158 Interworking with PRB BLANKING
    [Documentation]         The aim of this test is to check that allocation of PRBs per cell is correct for cell with Both Edge PRB blanking
    ...                  BaseBand Pooling Mode used is LoadMetric.
    ...                  From Sherpa micro L1L2 traces:
    ...                     Each cell, for DL and UL, has a guaranteed minimum amount of PRBs available.
    ...                     Remaining PRB processing resources are shared dynamically between cells mapped to the same L1 instance depending.
    ...                     on Gbr/noGbrRequest traffic infos.
    ...                     cells with PRB blanking activated never get more PRBs assigned than they can use on the air interface.

    [Arguments]            ${params}        ${Vendor_Param}
    Set Suite Variable     ${params}
    Init Sequence          ${params}
    Step                   Set RAD Params Of 1227
    Step                   Config1227.Vendor File Config With Specific Settings     argument=${Vendor_Param}
    Step                   Config9158.Update 9158-G Params in OAM SCF
    Step                   TC 1227 SA Call of 2 UEs with GBR UL DL Traffic       # Predefined CallProfile
    Step                   Calling Panda Extract Csv function
    Step                   Verification of PRB allocation values

Verification of PRB allocation values
    [Documentation]     Verification of PRB allocation values in (Ul/Dl)PrbPoolingAllocationSubpool and
    ...   (Ul/Dl)PrbPoolingAllocationReport of Sherpa event45 messages
    ...   It is assumed that NIDD FddNrCellConfigTradeoff is set to max cells (feature CB6913)
    ...   It is assumed that:
    ...         NIDD actPRBBlanking is set to TRUE and LOW and HIGH edge PRB blanked values set (14 in low and 12 in high) for DL and UL
    ...         14 + 26 PRB are so blanked in UL + DL part
    ...   Dl L1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity (1 subpool Max Num Stream PRB) = 300 PRB
    ...   Dl NumMinStreamPrb is the sum of streamPRB.min for all cell: 48 Prbbmin * 2 (conversion A2 prb->stream) *2 (cells) = 192
    ...   Dl NumMaxStreamPrb is the sum of streamPRB.max for all cell:
    ...   80(106-(12+14)Blanking) Prbmax * 2 (conversion DL A2 prb->stream) *2 (cells) = 320
    ...   Dl NumAllocStreamPrb1 is the streamPRB allocated for selected cell (round robin) : set to 0 in LB
    ...   Dl NumAllocStreamPrb2 is the streamPRB allocated globaly for all the other cell (Load Based) :
    ...         Dl NumAllocStreamPrb2 = Dl L1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity-Dl NumAllocStreamPrb1 = 300-0 =300
    ...   Ul L1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity (1 subpool Max Num Stream PRB) = 300 PRB
    ...   Ul NumMinStreamPrb is the sum of streamPRB.min for all cell: 36 Prbbmin * 4 (conversion A4 prb->stream) *2 (cells) = 288
    ...   Ul NumMaxStreamPrb is the sum of streamPRB.max for all cell:
    ...   80(106-(12+14)Blanking) Prbmax * 4 (conversion DL A4 prb->stream) *2 (cells) = 640
    ...   Ul NumAllocStreamPrb1 is the streamPRB allocated for selected cell (round robin) : set to 0 in LB
    ...   Ul NumAllocStreamPrb2 is the streamPRB allocated globaly for all the other cell (Load Based) :
    ...   Ul NumAllocStreamPrb2 = Dl L1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity-Dl NumAllocStreamPrb1 = 300-0 =300
    ...   UL NumMinPrbAlloc should be equal to 36, UL NumMaxPrbAlloc should be equal to 80
    ...   DL NumMinPrbAlloc should be equal to 48, UL NumMaxPrbAlloc should be equal to 80
    ...   ulStat_PRB_MAX should be less or equal to 27 (Prballocaed by BBRM minus 2x6 PRB for long PUCCH)-->here 39-12=27 if cell is privileged one)
    ...   ulStat_PRB_MAX should be less or equal to 24 (Prballocaed by BBRM minus 2x6 PRB for long PUCCH)-->here 36-12=24 if cell is not privileged)
    ...   dlStat_PRB_MAX should be less or equal to 72 (Prballocaed by BBRM minus remaining RBG)-->here 80-8=72 if cell is privileged one)
    ...   dlStat_PRB_MAX should be less or equal to 64 (Prballocaed by BBRM minus remaining RBG)-->here 70-6=64 if cell is not privileged)

    [Arguments]
    ${file_path_Dl_PrbPollingAllocationSubpool} =      set variable    ${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/Dl_PrbPoolingAllocationSubpool_45_.csv
    ${file_path_Ul_PrbPollingAllocationSubpool} =      set variable    ${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/Ul_PrbPoolingAllocationSubpool_45_.csv
    ${Dl_l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity}    Check Regex Value In File Column    file=${file_path_Dl_PrbPollingAllocationSubpool}
    ...                                 Column_name=l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity    regex_tocheck=300   # l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity
    ${Check_Dl_l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity} =     Set Variable If   ${Dl_l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity}==True
    ...                                            DL L1 SubPool capacity in stream PRB is equal to 300 for chBw=20MHz
    ...                                            ${Dl_l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity}==False
    ...                                            DL L1 SubPool capacity in stream PRB is not equal to 300 for chBw=20MHz
    Dated Log New Line     ${Check_Dl_l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity}
    should be true              ${Dl_l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity}==True
    ${Ul_l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity}    Check Regex Value In File Column    file=${file_path_Ul_PrbPollingAllocationSubpool}
    ...                                 Column_name=l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity    regex_tocheck=300   # l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity
    ${Check_Ul_l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity} =     Set Variable If   ${Ul_l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity}==True
    ...                                            UL L1 SubPool capacity in stream PRB is equal to 300 for chBw=20MHz
    ...                                            ${Ul_l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity}==False
    ...                                            UL L1 SubPool capacity in stream PRB is not equal to 300 for chBw=20MHz
    Dated Log New Line     ${Check_Ul_l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity}
    should be true              ${Ul_l1SubPoolStreamPrbCapacity}==True

    ${file_path_Dl_PrbPollingAllocationReport} =      set variable    ${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/Dl_PrbPoolingAllocationReport_45_.csv
    ${file_path_Ul_PrbPollingAllocationReport} =      set variable    ${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/Ul_PrbPoolingAllocationReport_45_.csv
    ${Dl_NumMinPrbAlloc}    Check Regex Value In File Column    file=${file_path_Dl_PrbPollingAllocationReport}
    ...                                 Column_name=NumMinPrbAlloc    regex_tocheck=48
    ${Check_Dl_NumMinPrbAlloc} =     Set Variable If   ${Dl_NumMinPrbAlloc}==True
    ...                                            DL NumMinPrbAlloc is equal to 48 for chBw=20MHz
    ...                                            ${Dl_NumMinPrbAlloc}==False
    ...                                            DL NumMinPrbAlloc is not equal to 48 for chBw=20MHz
    Dated Log New Line     ${Check_Dl_NumMinPrbAlloc}
    should be true              ${Dl_NumMinPrbAlloc}==True
    ${Ul_NumMinPrbAlloc}    Check Regex Value In File Column    file=${file_path_Ul_PrbPollingAllocationReport}
    ...                                 Column_name=NumMinPrbAlloc    regex_tocheck=36
    ${Check_Ul_NumMinPrbAlloc} =     Set Variable If   ${Ul_NumMinPrbAlloc}==True
    ...                                            UL NumMinPrbAlloc is equal to 36 for chBw=20MHz
    ...                                            ${Ul_NumMinPrbAlloc}==False
    ...                                            UL NumMinPrbAlloc is not equal to 36 for chBw=20MHz
    Dated Log New Line     ${Check_Ul_NumMinPrbAlloc}
    should be true              ${Ul_NumMinPrbAlloc}==True

    ${file_path_Dl_PrbPollingAllocationReport} =      set variable    ${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/Dl_PrbPoolingAllocationReport_45_.csv
    ${file_path_Ul_PrbPollingAllocationReport} =      set variable    ${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/Ul_PrbPoolingAllocationReport_45_.csv
    ${Dl_NumMaxPrbAlloc}    Check Regex Value In File Column    file=${file_path_Dl_PrbPollingAllocationReport}
    ...                                 Column_name=NumMaxPrbAlloc    regex_tocheck=80
    ${Check_Dl_NumMaxPrbAlloc} =     Set Variable If   ${Dl_NumMaxPrbAlloc}==True
    ...                                            DL NumMaxPrbAlloc is equal to 80 for chBw=20MHz
    ...                                            ${Dl_NumMaxPrbAlloc}==False
    ...                                            DL NumMaxPrbAlloc is not equal to 80 for chBw=20MHz
    Dated Log New Line     ${Check_Dl_NumMaxPrbAlloc}
    should be true              ${Dl_NumMaxPrbAlloc}==True
    ${Ul_NumMaxPrbAlloc}    Check Regex Value In File Column    file=${file_path_Ul_PrbPollingAllocationReport}
    ...                                 Column_name=NumMaxPrbAlloc    regex_tocheck=80
    ${Check_Ul_NumMaxPrbAlloc} =     Set Variable If   ${Ul_NumMaxPrbAlloc}==True
    ...                                            UL NumMaxPrbAlloc is equal to 80 for chBw=20MHz
    ...                                            ${Ul_NumMaxPrbAlloc}==False
    ...                                            UL NumMaxPrbAlloc is not equal to 80 for chBw=20MHz
    Dated Log New Line     ${Check_Ul_NumMaxPrbAlloc}
    should be true              ${Ul_NumMaxPrbAlloc}==True

    ${file_path_macro_ulStat} =      set variable    ${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/macro__ulStat.csv
    ${file_path_macro_dlStat} =      set variable    ${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/macro__dlStat.csv
    ${ulStat_PRB_MAX}    Check Values on Operator In File    file=${file_path_macro_ulStat}
    ...                                 column_name=MAX PRB     check_operator=<=     valuetocheck=3
    ${Check_ulStat_PRB_MAX} =     Set Variable If   ${ulStat_PRB_MAX}==True
    ...                                            The number of UL Max PRB is >= to 3
    ...                                            ${ulStat_PRB_MAX}==False
    ...                                            The number of UL Max PRB is not > to 3
    Dated Log New Line     ${Check_ulStat_PRB_MAX}
    should be true              ${ulStat_PRB_MAX}==True
    ${dlStat_PRB_MAX}    Check Values on Operator In File    file=${file_path_macro_dlStat}
    ...                                 column_name=MAX PRB     check_operator=>=     valuetocheck=72
    ${Check_dlStat_PRB_MAX} =     Set Variable If   ${dlStat_PRB_MAX}==True
    ...                                            The number of UL Max PRB is <= to 72
    ...                                            ${dlStat_PRB_MAX}==False
    ...                                            The number of UL Max PRB is not > to 72
    Dated Log New Line     ${Check_dlStat_PRB_MAX}
    should be true              ${dlStat_PRB_MAX}==True

CB009158-G_keywords.End Of TC Teardown
   [Documentation]        At the end of each TC :
   ...                      - show the Diagnosis of the TC steps
   ...                      - collect the gnb Snapshot
   ...                      - if TC failed, collect also AP sosReport

   Dated Log              End Of TC : start
  Oam.OAM Get Snapshot
   Run Keyword If Test Failed     Setup.Get Sos Report
   GenericTest.Display Diagnosis
   Dated Log              End of TC : end

